title: "llm-gateway"
abstract: "A cost-aware, OpenAI-compatible LLM gateway that routes requests across model tiers by complexity, budget, cost cap and latency SLO, with fallbacks, retries, circuit breakers, caching, per-tenant budgets and rate limits, and a synthetic replay benchmark."
